      "comment": "Timaeus: Albedo",
      "content": "Timaeus regards Albedo as an alchemy prodigy and Mondstadt's top alchemical talent, a man who appeared from outside the city and was taken in as Chief Alchemist and Captain of the Investigation Team. He admires his theory as refreshingly unbridled and says it works in practice. In the First Experiment Albedo calls Timaeus his assistant, keeps him on task and corrects his guesses.",
