    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Ying'er",
        "Smoldersleet",
        "Smoldersleet Elixir",
        "Smoldersleet Potion",
        "Scent of Spring"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Timaeus: Ying'er and the Smoldersleet Potion",
      "content": "During the limited-time A Study in Potions event (2.4), Timaeus tried to synthesise a legendary Smoldersleet Elixir he had read about and failed. A clue in the book (\"the artificer amidst quiet doors hides, the scented wind in the harbor abides\") sent him, the Traveler and Paimon to Chihu Rock in Liyue Harbor, where he found the young maker, Ying'er. He was disappointed that it was a perfume used for cosmetics. She helped him make a Smoldersleet Potion, which he gave the Traveler to test.",
