      "comment": "Timaeus: The First Experiment",
      "content": "Albedo's Dragonspine experiment (Princeps Cretaceus Chapter, Act I). Timaeus collates the data and argues that the Traveler and slimes share an elemental nature without Visions. Albedo rejects the idea and asks him to slow down. A Cryo Specter Archive entry later mentions this hypothesis.",
